{"title":"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/accc80fdf164cef264f56a82b6f9f6add320fe05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /> be positive integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/c/cac3f9893f600f47ff79076360009ffdd222dfa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\neq y\\neq z \\neq x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"17\" /> .Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/56366cbef963b44b24f2b97c3db0fc34d36dffab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+y+z)(xy+yz+zx-2)\\geq 9xyz.\\]\" width=\"300\" height=\"18\" />\nWhen does the equality hold?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the equation is symmetric and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/accc80fdf164cef264f56a82b6f9f6add320fe05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /> are distinct integers WLOG we can assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/6/ea612c92b725c9f2ea2d68874617242587ca5198.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\geq y+1\\geq z+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e9b3a5dce2bda77a4fd1966f94815d5a6d56d4d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}   x+y+z\\geq 3(z+1)\\\\   xy+yz+xz-2 = y(x+z)+xy-2 \\geq (z+1)(2z+2)+z(z+2)-2 \\\\   xy+yz+xz-2 \\geq 3z(z+2) \\end{align*}\" width=\"556\" height=\"68\" />\nHence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/e/06e19b24b54e55eb1debd2ab894fcfd2e2e078d0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+y+z)(xy+yz+xz-2)\\geq 9(z)(z+1)(z+2)\\]\" width=\"399\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>THIS IS A FAKESOLVE: The inequality in the last line proven is a lot weaker than the original inequality. This needs to be fixed.\nhs\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO\" title=\"2017 JBMO\">2017 JBMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13_contests\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> All JBMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017163638\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 72/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 868/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 36/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1375/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.367      1 Template:JBMO_box\n100.00%    8.367      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15709:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017163638 and revision id 286871. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}